  "summary": [
    "C8: three sources of one supplied-map subset-constancy contract, across Boolean ordinal-palette, Prop Boolean-palette, and public Prop ordinal-palette interfaces. GTBase.monochromatic.monochromatic_on is exactly MathComp constant of the enumerated colour sequence over any finite domain and eqType palette. Pairwise reflection avoids a default palette inhabitant, so empty sets and empty palettes keep their original behaviour. No graph adjacency or proper-colouring condition is introduced.",
    "The public GTBase.surface.same_colour_on is an explicit pinned repository source, not an inventory omission or non-corpus workaround. All sixteen statement-reaching declarations are frozen: three sources, eight chains, five rows. Two further non-row public/alias contracts (clustered_chromatic_at_most and X138 clustered_two_colourable) are frozen too; the graph-local existential and its existing fidelity warning are unchanged.",
    "Complete rows: X181 keeps maximal cliques of size at least two, the full Boolean finite-function/window/whp chain and its upper-half-only partial proxy; U13 keeps maximum cliques, supplied Boolean colours, positivity and induced odd-cycle exclusion; X194 keeps k>=2 and one uniform c before all graphs; X218 keeps the entire defective-and-clustered conjunction and all blocked placeholders; X138 keeps its uniform bound, girth/degree, connectedness and orientable-only partial surface scope. No row body, doc block, status, or guard is changed.",
    "No earlier committed migration snapshot reaches these sources at the baseline. The unrelated A5 U13 subgraph row and all earlier family histories stay unchanged. U13 has a separately recorded unproved K1 concern (its positive-vertex guard may permit an unsplittable singleton maximum clique); C8 preserves this exact legacy encoding and does not repair it.",
    "Proof checks are separate from textual discovery: exact Section/API types, all five closed row iff types, strict frozen/live compiled closures and public-only positive/negative/empty-palette clients are required. See the external C8 evidence directory and subsequent independent step-10/coordinator review."
  ],
